  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0\n  - Added the support to specify the sender display name.\n  - Added the support to raise a `EmailProviderException` when the email provider fails to send an email.\n\n1.1.0\n  - Added the support to send emails with attachments.\n  - Added a new overload method `EmailRecipientCollection<TModel>.Add(EmailAddress, TModel)`.\n\n1.0.0\n  - Initial release with Emailing infrastructure.",
